# Amazing Spider-Man: "Each legendary spell you cast that's one or more colors has web-slinging {G}{W}{U}." Only a legendary, coloured
# spell has it, and only once Peter Parker has transformed. Bot1 has Llanowar Elves tapped for mana as the creature to return. Before the
# transform, the second Peter Parker can't be web-slung; after it, a nonlegendary Ornithopter (colorless) or Savannah Lions (white) in hand still can't be.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Llanowar Elves
Peter Parker
Peter Parker
Ornithopter
Savannah Lions
Plains x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Peter Parker.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
! Bot1.Hand.Peter Parker.Cast(Ability: Web-slinging)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Peter Parker.Activate(Ability: Transform)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves.Activate
! Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast(Ability: Web-slinging)
! Bot1.Hand.Savannah Lions.Cast(Ability: Web-slinging)

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Amazing Spider-Man.Power = 4
Bot1.Hand = Ornithopter; Peter Parker; Savannah Lions
Bot1.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves.Tapped = true
